        "12⁷"
      ],
      "correct": 0,
      "points": 10,
      "explanation": "When multiplying with the same base, add the indices: 2³ × 2⁴ = 2³⁺⁴ = 2⁷"
    },
    {
      "question": "Simplify: 5⁸ ÷ 5³",
      "options": [
        "5⁵",
        "5¹¹",
        "1⁵",
        "25⁵"
      ],
      "correct": 0,
      "points": 10,
      "explanation": "When dividing with the same base, subtract the indices: 5⁸ ÷ 5³ = 5⁸⁻³ = 5⁵"
